            <dt>What does the AI for ADHD project specialize in?</dt>
            <dd>We help people set up personalized, AI-powered task completion systems based on delegation. You get dedicated digital Allies—The Sorter, The Breaker, The Chaser, and The Starter—who do the heavy lifting so tasks actually get crossed off your list.</dd>

            <dt>Is the AI for ADHD project free to access?</dt>
